    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Veins \u2013 The Ultimate Survival Space Mining RPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost in the Void, Fighting to Survive</strong><br>After being pulled into a black hole, you awaken in a hostile, uncharted galaxy with no way home. Stranded and alone\u2014save for your AI assistant\u2014you must rely on limited knowledge, salvaged technologies, and your own ingenuity to survive. As you explore the galaxy, your AI companion will guide you with essential recipes, technologies, and tactical advice, helping you unravel the mysteries of this alien universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Massive Starships and Build Your Fleet</strong><br>Take control of colossal spaceships and outfit them for any challenge the galaxy throws your way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize mining vessels for efficient resource gathering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design combat-ready warships to defend against threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage advanced components and research powerful upgrades.<br>Build a fully customizable fleet that\u2019s ready to explore, defend, or dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim and Expand Your Space Station</strong><br>Your journey begins with the discovery of a derelict space station. Reclaim it as your base of operations, then:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild and expand it to support your growing ambitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new modules for crafting, research, and production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a shipyard to design and produce your fleet.<br>Turn your station into a thriving hub of activity and a launchpad for your cosmic adventures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Secrets and Salvage the Unknown</strong><br>The galaxy is littered with derelict ships\u2014remnants of a lost civilization\u2014that are still operational and fiercely hostile. Salvage these dangerous relics to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover lost technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new AI assistants to join your crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story of this enigmatic galaxy.<br>But be prepared\u2014these ancient machines will defend their secrets at all costs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research, Build, and Survive</strong><br>Gather resources, research groundbreaking technologies, and unlock the potential of this new world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop advanced tools, weapons, and ship modules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain an edge in mining, combat, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master RTS-inspired production systems to optimize your operations.<br>Every decision shapes your journey and determines your survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Universe is Yours to Shape</strong><br>In <i>Galactic Veins</i>, your path is your own. Will you become:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mining tycoon, dominating the trade?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fearless explorer, uncovering the galaxy\u2019s secrets?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical genius, commanding an unstoppable fleet?<br>With endless opportunities for action, strategy, and discovery, the galaxy is yours to conquer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to chart your course through the stars!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Veins \u2013 The Ultimate Survival Space Mining RPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost in the Void, Fighting to Survive</strong><br>After being pulled into a black hole, you awaken in a hostile, uncharted galaxy with no way home. Stranded and alone\u2014save for your AI assistant\u2014you must rely on limited knowledge, salvaged technologies, and your own ingenuity to survive. As you explore the galaxy, your AI companion will guide you with essential recipes, technologies, and tactical advice, helping you unravel the mysteries of this alien universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Massive Starships and Build Your Fleet</strong><br>Take control of colossal spaceships and outfit them for any challenge the galaxy throws your way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize mining vessels for efficient resource gathering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design combat-ready warships to defend against threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage advanced components and research powerful upgrades.<br>Build a fully customizable fleet that\u2019s ready to explore, defend, or dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim and Expand Your Space Station</strong><br>Your journey begins with the discovery of a derelict space station. Reclaim it as your base of operations, then:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild and expand it to support your growing ambitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new modules for crafting, research, and production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a shipyard to design and produce your fleet.<br>Turn your station into a thriving hub of activity and a launchpad for your cosmic adventures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Secrets and Salvage the Unknown</strong><br>The galaxy is littered with derelict ships\u2014remnants of a lost civilization\u2014that are still operational and fiercely hostile. Salvage these dangerous relics to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover lost technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new AI assistants to join your crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story of this enigmatic galaxy.<br>But be prepared\u2014these ancient machines will defend their secrets at all costs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research, Build, and Survive</strong><br>Gather resources, research groundbreaking technologies, and unlock the potential of this new world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop advanced tools, weapons, and ship modules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain an edge in mining, combat, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master RTS-inspired production systems to optimize your operations.<br>Every decision shapes your journey and determines your survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Universe is Yours to Shape</strong><br>In <i>Galactic Veins</i>, your path is your own. Will you become:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mining tycoon, dominating the trade?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fearless explorer, uncovering the galaxy\u2019s secrets?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tactical genius, commanding an unstoppable fleet?<br>With endless opportunities for action, strategy, and discovery, the galaxy is yours to conquer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to chart your course through the stars!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Galactic Veins is a groundbreaking survival RPG that seamlessly blends action and RTS. Lost in an uncharted galaxy, you'll explore hostile regions filled with danger and mystery. Harvest resources, salvage technologies, and uncover the secrets of the universe as you fight to find your way back home.",
